GT4Recomp {version}

GT4Recomp is an unofficial fan project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc. or Polyphony Digital Inc.

"Gran Turismo", "GT", the Gran Turismo 4 logo, the GT emblem and the Gran Turismo 4 cover artwork are trademarks or copyrighted works of Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc. and/or Polyphony Digital Inc. They are used here only to identify the game. No game data is included in the source repository. You need your own copy of Gran Turismo 4 (USA, v2.00), or of Gran Turismo 4 Spec II v1.10 for that game, to play.
